## Scenarios

### Core Lexer Keyword Tokenization

#### tokenizes fn keyword

- Verify: tokenizes fn keyword
   - Expected: token.kind equals `TokenKind.KwFn`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 5 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: tokenizes fn keyword")
var lexer = lexer_new("fn")
val token = lexer_next_token(lexer)
expect(token.kind).to_equal(TokenKind.KwFn)
```

</details>

